{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2022-11-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN TEMPLETON TO CELEBRATE ITS 75TH ANNIVERSARY WITH NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE BELL RINGING ON NOVEMBER 15, 2022', 'text': 'SAN MATEO, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FRANKLIN RESOURCES, INC. [NYSE:BEN], A GLOBAL INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT ORGANIZATION OPERATING AS FRANKLIN TEMPLETON, WILL RING THE OPENING BELL AT THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE ON TUESDAY, NOVEMBER 15TH TO MARK THE 75TH ANNIVERSARY OF THE COMPANY. PRESIDENT AND CEO JENNY JOHNSON, ALONG WITH COLLEAGUES AND BOARD MEMBERS, WILL BE AT THE STOCK EXCHANGE TO COMMEMORATE THIS IMPORTANT MILESTONE.'}